=== REASONING (architecture) ===
  A fully native, Apple-idiomatic, Shared-FREE surface (imports Foundation/OSLog/SwiftUI only) composed of:
   (1) pure reducer (AITripNameSuggestionReducer) — verbatim port of useAiStream.handleEvent (delta
       accumulation, done/error terminals, inert tool frames, paused-confirm), the draft-path builder
       (encodeURIComponent-parity percent-encoding + the `/ai/trips/0/name/draft` fallback), and the
       staleness helper; framework-free, unit-testable in isolation;
   (2) SSE frame parser (SSEFrameParser) — port of parseSSEFrame/toTypedEvent (event:/data: fields,
       comment skip, multi-line data join, unknown-event drop);
   (3) derived view-state machine (AITripNameSuggestionViewState) — port of AIFeatureCard + AiOutputPanel
       (output none/thinking/text/error + buttonDisabled = !canStart||streaming||offline||!aiEnabled);
   (4) telemetry seam (P1/S11 view.opened) with an OSLog default sink (slug-only, no PII, ADR-016);
   (5) streaming-driver seam (AITripNameStreamDriver, the native analogue of useAiStream) + a REAL
       URLSession SSE driver (faithful POST + text/event-stream parse + AbortController-style cancel) +
       DEBUG preview/test doubles. The view performs NO HTTP and references NO KMP symbol directly; the
       host injects the live driver (the bind-via-seam pattern ExportStatusWidget established, since the
       composition root is out of allowed-files scope and the shared core exposes no AI-stream holder);
   (6) @MainActor @Observable model (AITripNameSuggestionModel) owning the snapshot + gate/offline/trip
       inputs, gating suggest() like the web button and coalescing in-flight calls (web runningRef),
       emitting view.opened once;
   (7) the SwiftUI view rendering EVERY state with the real TS component library (TSButton/TSBadge/
       TSSkeleton/TSFreshnessIndicator + tokens), reduce-motion-aware symbol pulse, full VoiceOver labels/
       traits, Dynamic-Type system fonts, + 5 #Preview state matrices. The gated-off branch reproduces
       withAiFeature returning null (ADR-015) — the single legitimately-hidden state; every data-bearing
       state always renders.

